    "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:42:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-05T13:42:03Z",
    "body": "I'm unclear whether this refers to the `<img>` element's content-edge, padding-edge, border-edge, or the actual image edge before it gets clipped by the `<img>` element.\n\nFrom testing, it seems that:\n- Blink uses the border-edge.\n- Gecko uses the actual image edge, so object-position is taken into account.\n- Internet Explorer uses the content-edge.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
